Package: tind-ai-users
Version: 0.1.0~test1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, nftables, passwd, python3
Installed-Size: 84
Description: Tind AI box: the walls (two system users, folders, firewall)
 Two system users that never log in. tind-ai-local reads the journal and the
 request, redacts it into a briefing and has no network at all. tind-ai-remote
 reads only the briefings and talks only to the selected provider's API host.
 Briefings live in /var/lib/tind-ai/briefing/<uid> (written by the local user,
 read by the remote user and that human), answers in /var/lib/tind-ai/outbox/<uid>
 (written by the remote user, read by that human only). The firewall is its own
 nftables table (inet tind_ai); it never touches ufw's rules.
